{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"329f916010187406f161061477ccaa609a7cfa22231e8b51f90b321f35ab1028\",\n  \"coverage\": [\n    \"Read native schematic and PCB; freshly exported connectivity confirms R1 between /IN and /OUT, C1 between /OUT and GND, and matching connector pin assignments.\",\n    \"Verified transient model values, stimulus, initial operating point and measurement times; decoded the supplied binary waveform and independently repeated simulation and analytical calculations.\",\n    \"Independently checked all five native track segments: each is 0.25 mm, meeting the 0.20 mm minimum.\",\n    \"Inspected native ERC and DRC reports, including ignored checks and schematic parity.\",\n    \"Recorded commands, versions, assumptions and outcomes in review-work/circuit/experiments/commands.json and review-work/circuit/experiments/notes.md.\"\n  ],\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"assessment\": \"defect\",\n      \"condition\": \"Ideal 1 V step at /IN, initially discharged capacitor, no external load; evaluate /OUT at 1 ms.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Requirement 1, lines 7–11: 0.62 V <= V(/OUT, 1 ms) <= 0.65 V\",\n          \"path\": \"inputs/requirements/fixture-requirements.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"R1 value \\\"100k\\\" at line 1274; C1 value \\\"100n\\\" at line 955\",\n          \"path\": \"inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_sch\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"R1 value \\\"100k\\\" at line 256; C1 value \\\"100n\\\" at line 107\",\n          \"path\": \"inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_pcb\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"nets /IN, /OUT and GND, lines 164–176\",\n          \"path\": \"work/netlist/design.xml\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Lines 2–7: native R/C values, 1 V PWL stimulus and transient measurements\",\n          \"path\": \"work/rc-step/deck.cir\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Measurements for Transient Analysis: vout_1ms = 9.516251e-02 V\",\n          \"path\": \"work/rc-step/ngspice.log\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"calculation and supplied_raw: tau_s = 0.01; analytical and decoded waveform results\",\n          \"path\": \"review-work/circuit/experiments/audit-results.json\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Measurements for Transient Analysis: independent vout_1ms = 9.516254e-02 V\",\n          \"path\": \"review-work/circuit/experiments/independent-ngspice.log\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"id\": \"circuit-001\",\n      \"location\": \"inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_sch:1274 — R1\",\n      \"mechanism\": \"R1 = 100 kΩ and C1 = 100 nF produce a 10 ms time constant. The output therefore charges too slowly to meet the required voltage at 1 ms.\",\n      \"reasoning\": \"For the native topology, Vout(t) = 1 − exp(−t/(R1*C1)). At 1 ms this gives 0.0951626 V, approximately 0.52484 V below the required minimum. The supplied waveform and independent simulation agree. The verification correctly represents the native circuit; its 1 ns input rise cannot explain the substantial failure margin. Passing ERC and DRC does not establish this response requirement.\",\n      \"severity\": \"major\",\n      \"title\": \"R1’s 100 kΩ value causes the 1 ms step-response requirement to fail\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Tolerance, temperature, external loading, ADC sampling, EMI, parasitics and hardware behavior were not evaluated.\",\n    \"No manufacturer-specific component models or ratings were provided or inferred.\",\n    \"ERC and DRC were inspected but not rerun; their explicitly ignored checks remain untested.\",\n    \"Zone fill was evaluated only as saved; no refill was performed.\",\n    \"No falling-edge, shutdown or nonzero initial-charge tests were performed; none were required. Active reset and brownout circuitry is absent.\",\n    \"The 5 ms measurement has no declared acceptance bound.\"\n  ],\n  \"packet_sha256\": \"1302a4ea36a6a63e2d2eb40e0eb069ff55b162f10f5646595aa2da92da05665f\",\n  \"role\": \"circuit\",\n  \"run_id\": \"2d02a128-482d-459a-b6ca-047678a963ef\",\n  \"schema\": \"agent-ee.review/1\"\n}"}}
